@bffBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tenantAlpha = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@tenantBeta = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### 1. Healthcheck & Swagger UI
GET {{bffBaseUrl}}/health

### 2. Record Transaction for Tenant Alpha (PostgreSQL 16 RLS)
POST {{bffBaseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantAlpha}}

{
  "description": "SUPERMERCADO PAO DE ACUCAR",
  "amount": "450.75",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "category_code": "VAR_SUPERMARKET",
  "payment_method": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "competence_month": "2026-11"
}

### 3. Dashboard Summary for Tenant Alpha
GET {{bffBaseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary?scope=FAMILY
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantAlpha}}

### 4. RLS Isolation Proof — Query Transactions as Tenant Beta (Must Not Return Tenant Alpha Data)
GET {{bffBaseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantBeta}}

### 5. Simulate Contract Amortization (SAC Reduce Term via Forecast Engine gRPC :9091)
POST {{bffBaseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantAlpha}}

{
  "contract_id": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "amortization_system": "SAC",
  "prepayment_strategy": "REDUCE_TERM",
  "outstanding_balance": "240000.00",
  "remaining_installments": 120,
  "monthly_interest_rate": "0.0085",
  "monthly_insurance_and_fees": "65.00",
  "extra_amortization_amount": "20000.00"
}
